		</Entry>
		<Entry>
			<Title localize="yes">Learn the Basics of Programming</Title>
			<Details localize="yes">Explore the LabVIEW environment in a hands-on format with the LabVIEW Core 1 online course. This course covers topics including navigating the environment, dataflow programming, and using common development techniques as you develop basic applications.</Details>
			<Location localize="yes">https://www.ni.com/r/lvcore1?&amp;prodref=LabVIEW-2021</Location>
			<Mode>Evaluation,Licensed</Mode>
			<Type>Link</Type>
			<ContentID>LearnBasics</ContentID>
			<ButtonText localize="yes">Read more</ButtonText>
		</Entry>
		<Entry>
